        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "07cbbcf8-a9b4-3e75-83d0-01ef9b1d39e7",
                "word": "niewykształcony",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a2f13e8-3db2-3f27-bffe-cd994da638c0",
                        "entry_id": "07cbbcf8-a9b4-3e75-83d0-01ef9b1d39e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "niemający wykształcenia"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c63bf5d1-0b87-43b5-8c97-abd35aa3d3f8",
                                "sense_id": "7a2f13e8-3db2-3f27-bffe-cd994da638c0",
                                "text": "W rzeczywistości Mary Waszyngton była kobietą kłótliwą, niewykształconą i sprzeciwiała się karierze syna z czystej zazdrości."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b4f30e01-a97c-449f-be0f-d8ad18d0d011",
                        "source_entry_id": "07cbbcf8-a9b4-3e75-83d0-01ef9b1d39e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a2f13e8-3db2-3f27-bffe-cd994da638c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "uneducated",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "uneducated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ded63c9-2ba5-3ccb-9d73-062dfd145b71",
                                        "entry_id": "d14e7a02-c95b-3411-8d1b-421b22328c87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not educated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1c62eeb-8c0c-4ca5-a55a-413d3ac43ee1",
                                                "sense_id": "5ded63c9-2ba5-3ccb-9d73-062dfd145b71",
                                                "text": "Ben Carson said his Republican rivals aren’t his biggest threat in the presidential election – it’s uneducated voters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "uneducated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16ad91ba-ef10-3691-9ba2-c3b1169465ad",
                                        "entry_id": "961f4c80-222c-364d-95e6-74e89b51e3b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who lacks education."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd392ad9-1693-4501-9f92-2e876ef24fb3",
                                                "sense_id": "16ad91ba-ef10-3691-9ba2-c3b1169465ad",
                                                "text": "[…] A few mojaheddin and militants screaming about our oil money and yelling about foreign interference, and we a bunch of uneducateds, how could we have known that they would do this to us.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd846b5-8c2a-4717-b50b-cc807dbef9ce",
                                                "sense_id": "16ad91ba-ef10-3691-9ba2-c3b1169465ad",
                                                "text": "If you want to see evil in his books, you'll have to search into the uneducateds and the poors (something that is usually mistaked as racism from Lovecraft)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d87297a8-fa7b-49df-a509-c654ecfd1cd9",
                                                "sense_id": "16ad91ba-ef10-3691-9ba2-c3b1169465ad",
                                                "text": "So what happened? It’s fun to point the finger. Some say it was the poors, or the uneducateds, or even the third-party voters. No matter the scenario, it’s always fun to blame someone else and throw up your hands (while a finger on each is pointed of course)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc0cb47d-79bc-4eac-ae39-e4ec29aaf503",
                        "source_entry_id": "07cbbcf8-a9b4-3e75-83d0-01ef9b1d39e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a2f13e8-3db2-3f27-bffe-cd994da638c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "ungebildet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ungebildet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "286b6f8f-a398-3f80-b3c4-75a2a273d0d4",
                                        "entry_id": "d68b122f-9aa1-346a-9c00-600ffdfe2543",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kein Wissen, keine Bildung habend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faf26dd9-fc3e-4566-a6ae-dd10905a0ad3",
                                                "sense_id": "286b6f8f-a398-3f80-b3c4-75a2a273d0d4",
                                                "text": "Die meisten Selbstmordattentäter sind weder arm noch ungebildet."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d765ddf-e768-4722-beaf-d3959b5bb64e",
                        "source_entry_id": "07cbbcf8-a9b4-3e75-83d0-01ef9b1d39e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a2f13e8-3db2-3f27-bffe-cd994da638c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "необразованный",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "необразованный",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de05d64c-bdef-35b0-88f8-4feae341a189",
                                        "entry_id": "537adab4-6478-3598-adcc-3524007314f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "не имеющий достаточного образования; невежественный"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a128aaca-c1e3-45f2-9d23-655de660a790",
                                                "sense_id": "de05d64c-bdef-35b0-88f8-4feae341a189",
                                                "text": "Иван Кузмич, вышедший в офицеры из солдатских детей, был человек необразованный и простой, но самый честный и добрый."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb9fc4d-1e7f-4bdf-a53a-7c963dd6026c",
                                                "sense_id": "de05d64c-bdef-35b0-88f8-4feae341a189",
                                                "text": "Она прелестна, но она необразованна, дика, груба."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01d48ba1-2ece-4e02-8480-71d0f412ed88",
                                                "sense_id": "de05d64c-bdef-35b0-88f8-4feae341a189",
                                                "text": "В университетах наших преподавалось бог знает что, всего понемногу и без системы, какие-то обрывки наук, может быть, и специалистами (с грехом пополам, ибо необразованный человек редко бывает и хорошим специалистом), но все же людьми глубоко необразованными."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
